["https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Core/RelationshipType/describes", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Element describes each `to` Element. To denote the root(s) of a tree of elements in a collection, the rootElement property shall be used.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
